   ],
   "id": "T1",
   "judgement": {
    "kind": "answered",
    "quotes": [
     "`DateTimeOriginal` uses `OffsetTimeOriginal` when that offset matches\n   the imported `EXIF_OFFSET_PATTERN` constant whole, with hours up to the imported `CAMERA_OFFSET_MAX_HOURS` constant and minutes that are a minute of the hour; otherwise it is read in the time zone of the `timezone` field of the run settings (A8), and so is\n   `DateTime`."
    ],
